---
description: Tests and quality rules
globs:
  - "packages/*/test/**/*.ts"
  - "e2e/**/*"
  - "fixtures/**/*"
  - "tooling/vitest.shared.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Vitest coverage stays at 100% statements, branches, functions and lines per package; a `/* v8 ignore */` needs a reason.
- Wire changes update the golden envelopes (`pnpm golden`) and the mock Beacon tests.
- Quality commands: `pnpm lint`, `pnpm format:check`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test`, `pnpm test:mock`,
  `pnpm e2e:node`, `pnpm e2e:browser`, `pnpm size`, `pnpm pack:check`, or `make release-check`.
- Tests use obvious fake credentials only.
